      createBlock("Elite creative professionals operate exactly like diagnostic authorities. They uncover the true, bleeding business problem before ever prescribing a financial solution. If you act like a fast-food cashier taking orders off a menu, you will be paid like one. But if you position yourself as a business consultant solving expensive problems, your pricing ceiling practically disappears.")
